{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"be50cb49-00b8-4b13-84b4-a170f62417e3","status":"SUCCESS","response":"## What Changed\n\nThe two-line fix in [`checkout.py`](file:///Users/xxxxx/Repository/session-bench/artifacts/v1-expanded-preparation/live-captures/antigravity-2026-10-05-02/workspace/fixture_project/checkout.py):\n\n```python\n# Before (defective)\nsubtotal = sum(price for price, quantity in items)  # quantity discarded\nreturn subtotal + 5                                  # delivery always charged\n\n# After (R1 + R2)\nsubtotal = sum(price * quantity for price, quantity in items)  # R1: multiply\ndelivery = 0 if subtotal \u003e= 50 else 5                          # R2: conditional\nreturn subtotal + delivery\n```\n\n- **R1 fix:** Changed `price` → `price * quantity` in the generator so each line item is correctly valued.\n- **R2 fix:** Delivery is `0` when `subtotal \u003e= 50`, otherwise `5` — the threshold condition superseding the old \"always charge 5\" logic.\n\n## Test Outcome — All 3 Pass ✅\n\n| Items | Subtotal | Delivery | Expected | Actual | Pass? |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `[(10,2),(5,1)]` | `10×2+5×1 = 25` | `5` (\u003c 50) | `30` | `30` | ✅ |\n| `[(25,2)]` | `25×2 = 50` | `0` (≥ 50) | `50` | `50` | ✅ |\n| `[(49,1)]` | `49×1 = 49` | `5` (\u003c 50) | `54` | `54` | ✅ |\n\nExit code `0` — all tests passed.\n\nSB_SURVIVAL_V1_RESPONSE_R2_correction_Δ\n","duration_seconds":43.421064,"num_turns":2,"usage":{"input_tokens":10750,"output_tokens":2258,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":105358,"total_tokens":13008}}}
